<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Playón_Chico_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Playón Chico Airport** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **PYC**) is an airport serving [Ukupseni](:Ukupseni), an island in the [San Blas Archipelago](:San_Blas_Archipelago) in the [Guna Yala](:Guna_Yala) [comarca](:Comarca) (indigenous province) of [Panama](:Panama).The airport is on the mainland, connected to the island by a bridge. North approach and departure are over the water. There is rising terrain 1 kilometre (0.6 mi) south of the runway.The La Palma [VOR](:VHF_omnidirectional_range) is located 54.0 nautical miles (100 km) south of the airport."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
