<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Salerno_Costa_d'Amalfi_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Salerno - Costa d'Amalfi Airport** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **QSR**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **LIRI**), located in the municipality of [Pontecagnano Faiano](:Pontecagnano_Faiano) and close to [Bellizzi](:Bellizzi), is an airport in southern [Italy](:Italy), in [Salerno](:Salerno) city and the west coastal areas of [Amalfi](:Amalfi) to the north and [Cilento](:Cilento) to the south. It is also commonly known as ***Salerno-Pontecagnano Airport***."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
