<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hopedale,_Newfoundland_and_Labrador> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Hopedale (Inuit language: Agvituk) is a town located in the north of Labrador, the mainland portion of the Canadian province of Newfoundland and Labrador. Hopedale is the legislative capital of the Inuit Land Claims Area Nunatsiavut, and where the Nunatsiavut Assembly meets. As of the 2021 census it has a population of 596."@en .
