<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hopedale_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Hopedale Airport** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **YHO**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **CYHO**) is 1 [nautical mile](:Nautical_mile) (1.9 km; 1.2 mi) west of [Hopedale](:Hopedale%2C_Newfoundland_and_Labrador), [Newfoundland and Labrador](:Newfoundland_and_Labrador), [Canada](:Canada).The airport was built in the 1960s to provide air support for [Hopedale Air Station](:Hopedale_Air_Station), a [USAF](:USAF) station. After the US military left in 1968, the airport became a civilian airfield."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
