<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Angoulême_–_Cognac_International_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Angoulême – Cognac International Airport (French: Aéroport international d'Angoulême - Cognac), also known as Angoulême – Brie – Champniers Airport (French: Aéroport d'Angoulême - Brie - Champniers), (IATA: ANG, ICAO: LFBU) is an airport located 15 kilometres (9.3 mi) northeast of Angoulême, between Brie and Champniers, all communes of the Charente département in the Nouvelle-Aquitaine région of France."@en .
