<http://dbpedia.org/resource/El_Buen_Pastor_Airstrip> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**El Buen Pastor Airstrip** is a public dirt [airstrip](:Airstrip) located in [San Quintín](:San_Quint%C3%ADn%2C_Baja_California), [Municipality of Ensenada](:Ensenada_%28municipality%29), [Baja California](:Baja_California), [Mexico](:Mexico), near the [Federal Highway 1](:Federal_Highway_1). The airstrip is part of a medical clinic operated by the Mexican Medical Ministries, an interdenominational non-profit organization dedicated to providing low cost health care. The airstrip is used solely for [general aviation](:General_aviation) purposes. The EBP code is used as identifier.This air strip is no longer in service."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
