<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Playón_Chico_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Playón Chico Airport (IATA: PYC) is an airport serving Ukupseni, an island in the San Blas Archipelago in the Guna Yala comarca (indigenous province) of Panama. The airport is on the mainland, connected to the island by a bridge. North approach and departure are over the water. There is rising terrain 1 kilometre (0.6 mi) south of the runway. The La Palma VOR is located 54.0 nautical miles (100 km) south of the airport."@en .
