<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Jefferson_City_Memorial_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Jefferson City Memorial Airport** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **JEF**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **KJEF**, [FAA](:Federal_Aviation_Administration) [LID](:Location_identifier): **JEF**) is two miles (3 km) northeast of [Jefferson City](:Jefferson_City%2C_Missouri), in [Callaway County](:Callaway_County%2C_Missouri), [Missouri](:Missouri). It is owned by the City of Jefferson City.Ozark DC-3s and M404s stopped there from 1954 until [Columbia Regional Airport](:Columbia_Regional_Airport) opened in 1968."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
