<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Macará> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Macará is a city in the Loja Province of Ecuador. It is the seat of the Macará Canton and is on the border between Ecuador and Peru. The population as of a 1995 census was 11,841 and in 2009 it had an estimated population of 12,896. It is served by José María Velasco Ibarra Airport."@en .
