<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Doña_Ana_County_International_Jetport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Doña Ana County International Jetport** ([ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **KDNA**, [FAA](:Federal_Aviation_Administration) [LID](:Location_identifier): **DNA**) is a public-use airport located 4 mi (6.4 km) northwest of [Santa Teresa, New Mexico](:Santa_Teresa%2C_New_Mexico), United States.It is home to War Eagles Air Museum and Red Arrow Flight Academy. It is also the home of [EAA](:Experimental_Aircraft_Association) Chapter 1570, which also conducts [Young Eagles Day](:Young_Eagles) flights. It is the home of El Paso Skydive, the only skydiving operation in West Texas and all of New Mexico."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
