<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Arealva> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Arealva is a city in the state of São Paulo in Brazil. The population is 8,613 (2020 est.) in an area of 505 km². The elevation is 445 m. The Bauru-Arealva Airport (official name Moussa Nakhl Tobias State Airport) located at Arealva also serves the adjoining city of Bauru."@en .
