<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kotlas_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Kotlas Airport** (Template:Lang-ru ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **KSZ**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **ULKK**) is a small airport in [Arkhangelsk Oblast](:Arkhangelsk_Oblast), [Russia](:Russia) located 4 km southeast of [Kotlas](:Kotlas). It primarily services [general aviation](:General_aviation) and small [turboprop](:Turboprop) aircraft.There is passenger service to Arkhangelsk ([Vaskovo Airport](:Vaskovo_Airport%29) three times per week."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
