<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mykolaiv_Oblast> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mykolaiv Oblast (Ukrainian: Микола́ївська о́бласть, romanized: Mykoláyivsʹka óblastʹ, IPA: [mɪkoˈɫɑjiu̯sʲkɐ ˈɔbɫɐsʲtʲ]), also referred to as Mykolaivshchyna (Ukrainian: Микола́ївщина, romanized: Mykoláivshchyna, IPA: [mɪkoˈɫɑjiu̯ʃt͡ʃɪnɐ]) is an oblast (province) of Ukraine. The administrative center of the oblast is the city of Mykolaiv. At the most recent estimate, the population of the oblast stood at 1,108,394 (2021 est.)."@en .
