<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kotlas_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Kotlas Airport (Russian: Аэропорт Котлас) (IATA: KSZ, ICAO: ULKK) is a small airport in Arkhangelsk Oblast, Russia located 4 km southeast of Kotlas. It primarily services general aviation and small turboprop aircraft. There is passenger service to Arkhangelsk (Vaskovo Airport) three times per week."@en .
