<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Chitato_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Chitato Airport** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **PGI**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **FNCH**) is an airport serving [Dundo](:Dundo), [Angola](:Angola). The runway is 3 kilometres (1.9 mi) northwest of the city.The Chitato (Ident: **CH**) and Dundo (Ident: **DU**) [non-directional beacons](:Non-directional_beacon) are located south of the field.Dundo is also served by the larger [Dundo Airport](:Dundo_Airport), which is southwest of the city.The [IATA code](:IATA_code) refers to the town's colonial name of *Portugalía*."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
