<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Galatina_Air_Base> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Galatina Air Base (IATA: LCC, ICAO: LIBN) is an airbase near Galatina, south of the city of Lecce in the Apulia (Puglia) region of Italy. Currently the Italian Air Force's 10th Aircraft Maintenance Unit is based there, which maintains the air force's MB-339 training and light attack jets."@en .
