<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Santa_María_de_Mulegé_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Santa María de Mulegé Airport** or **Playa María Airport** is an [airstrip](:Airstrip) located North of [Santa Rosalía](:Santa_Rosal%C3%ADa%2C_Baja_California_Sur), [Baja California Sur](:Baja_California_Sur), [Mexico](:Mexico). It is handled by the [Municipality of Mulegé](:Muleg%C3%A9_%28municipality%29) Government. The SMM code is used as identifier.    This article about a Mexican airport is a [stub](:Wikipedia%3AStub). You can help Wikipedia by [expanding it](//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Santa_Mar%C3%ADa_de_Muleg%C3%A9_Airport&action=edit)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
