<http://dbpedia.org/resource/El_Buen_Pastor_Airstrip> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "El Buen Pastor Airstrip is a public dirt airstrip located in San Quintín, Municipality of Ensenada, Baja California, Mexico, near the Federal Highway 1. The airstrip is part of a medical clinic operated by the , an interdenominational non-profit organization dedicated to providing low cost health care. The airstrip is used solely for general aviation purposes. The EBP code is used as identifier. This air strip is no longer in service."@en .
