<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Tasiilaq_Heliport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Tasiilaq Heliport** or **Ammassalik Heliport** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **AGM**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **BGAM**) is a [heliport](:Heliport) in [Tasiilaq](:Tasiilaq), a town located on the [Ammassalik Island](:Ammassalik_Island) in the [Sermersooq](:Sermersooq) municipality, in southeastern [Greenland](:Greenland). Until 1997 the heliport was known as Ammassalik Heliport and is still listed by the Danish authorities under that name."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
