<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Monteagudo_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Monteagudo Airport (Spanish: Aeropuerto Monteagudo, IATA: MHW, ICAO: SLAG) is an airport serving Monteagudo, a town in the Chuquisaca Department of Bolivia. The airport is in a fold valley of the Cordillera Central range, with mountainous terrain nearby to the east and west. The Monteagudo non-directional beacon (Ident: AGU) is located on the field."@en .
