<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ascensión_de_Guarayos_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Ascención de Guarayos Airport** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **ASC**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **SLAS**) is an airport serving [Ascención de Guarayos](:Ascenci%C3%B3n_de_Guarayos), a town in the [Santa Cruz Department](:Santa_Cruz_Department%2C_Bolivia) of [Bolivia](:Bolivia). The airport is 3 kilometres (1.9 mi) southeast of the town.The Ascencion De Guarayos [non-directional beacon](:Non-directional_beacon) (Ident: **ASG**) is located on the field."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
