<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Isortoq_Heliport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Isortoq Heliport** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **IOQ**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **BGIS**) is a [heliport](:Heliport) in [Isortoq](:Isortoq), a village in the [Sermersooq](:Sermersooq) municipality in southeastern [Greenland](:Greenland). The heliport is considered a *helistop*, and is served by [Air Greenland](:Air_Greenland) as part of a government contract."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
