<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Wonju> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Wonju** (Template:IPA-ko is the most populous [city](:Administrative_divisions_of_South_Korea) in [Gangwon Province](:Gangwon_Province%2C_South_Korea), [South Korea](:South_Korea). The city is located approximately 140 kilometres (87 mi) east of [Seoul](:Seoul). Wonju was the site of [three crucial battles](:Battle_of_Wonju_%28disambiguation%29) during the [Korean War](:Korean_War)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
