<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hormozgan_province> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Hormozgan Province (Persian: استان هرمزگان is one of the 31 provinces of Iran. It is in the south of the country, in Iran's Region 2, facing Oman, UAE and the Hormuz Straits. Its area is 70,697 km2 (27,296 sq mi), and its provincial capital is Bandar Abbas. The province has fourteen islands in the Persian Gulf and 1,000 km (620 mi) of coastline."@en .
