<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bob_Baker_Memorial_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Bob Baker Memorial Airport** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **IAN**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **PAIK**, [FAA](:Federal_Aviation_Administration) [LID](:Location_identifier): **IAN**) is a public [airport](:Airport) located one mile (2 km) north of the [central business district](:Central_business_district) of [Kiana](:Kiana%2C_Alaska), a city in the [Northwest Arctic Borough](:Northwest_Arctic_Borough%2C_Alaska) of the [U.S. state](:U%2ES%2E_state) of [Alaska](:Alaska). The airport is owned by the state."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
