<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Creswell,_Oregon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Creswell** is a city in the [Willamette Valley](:Willamette_Valley) of [Lane County](:Lane_County%2C_Oregon), [Oregon](:Oregon), United States, located 13 miles (21 km) south of [Eugene, Oregon](:Eugene%2C_Oregon). The population at the 2010 census was 5,031."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
