<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Taranto-Grottaglie_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Taranto-Grottaglie \"Marcello Arlotta\" Airport** (Template:Lang-it ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **TAR**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **LIBG**) is an [airport](:Airport) serving [Taranto](:Taranto) and [Grottaglie](:Grottaglie), both *[comunes](:Comune)* in the [province of Taranto](:Province_of_Taranto) in [Italy](:Italy). The airport is located 1.5 km (0.8 NM) from the city of [Monteiasi](:Monteiasi), 4 km (2.2 NM) from Grottaglie and 16 km (8.6 NM) from Taranto. It is named for Marcello Arlotta (1886-1918), an Italian aviator."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
