<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Galatina_Air_Base> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Galatina Air Base** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **LCC**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **LIBN**) is an airbase near [Galatina](:Galatina), south of the city of [Lecce](:Lecce) in the [Apulia](:Apulia) (*Puglia*) region of [Italy](:Italy). Currently the [Italian Air Force](:Italian_Air_Force)'s 10th Aircraft Maintenance Unit is based there, which maintains the air force's [MB-339](:Aermacchi_MB-339) training and light attack jets."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
