<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ascensión_de_Guarayos_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ascención de Guarayos Airport (IATA: ASC, ICAO: SLAS) is an airport serving Ascención de Guarayos, a town in the Santa Cruz Department of Bolivia. The airport is 3 kilometres (1.9 mi) southeast of the town. The Ascencion De Guarayos non-directional beacon (Ident: ASG) is located on the field."@en .
