<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bauru-Arealva_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Moussa Nakhl Tobias State Airport** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **JTC**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **SBAE**), commonly known as **Bauru–Arealva Airport** is the main airport serving [Bauru](:Bauru) and [Arealva](:Arealva), [Brazil](:Brazil). It is named after the [Lebanese](:Lebanon) businessman and vice-mayor Moussa Nakhl Tobias (1940-2003), who immigrated to Brazil in 1959 and established himself in Bauru.It is operated by [Rede Voa](:Rede_Voa)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
