<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mykolaiv_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Mykolaiv International Airport**, also known as **Nikolaev Airport** (Template:Lang-ua, Template:Lang-ru ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **NLV**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **UKON**) is an airport in [Mykolaiv](:Mykolaiv) (Nikolaev in [Russian](:Russian_language%29), in the [Mykolaiv Oblast](:Mykolaiv_Oblast) of [Ukraine](:Ukraine). The [Class B](:Airspace_classes) airport has a modern runway ready to receive aircraft with landing weight up to 220 tonnes (220 long tons; 240 short tons) and to hold eight [Il-76](:Il-76) aircraft equipped with lighting, radio and navigation equipment. The airport is also increased to receive the [Airbus 310](:Airbus_310)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
