<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Generalitat_de_Catalunya> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Generalitat de Catalunya (Catalan pronunciation: [ʒənəɾəliˈtad də kətəˈluɲə]; Aranese: Generalitat de Catalonha; Spanish: Generalidad de Cataluña), or the Government of Catalonia, is the institutional system by which Catalonia politically organizes its self-government. It is formed by the Parliament of Catalonia, the Presidency of the Generalitat de Catalunya, and the Executive Council of Catalonia (also very often referred to as Govern, \"Government\"). Its headquarters are at the Palau de la Generalitat, in the city of Barcelona."@en .
