<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Qiemo_Airport_(former)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Qiemo Airport** was an [airport](:Airport) serving [Qiemo Town](:Qiemo_Town) in [Xinjiang Uyghur Autonomous Region](:Xinjiang_Uyghur_Autonomous_Region), China. After passenger service to the airport ended in 2011, a 2012 [CAAC](:Civil_Aviation_Administration_of_China) report stated that Qiemo Airport had been closed. It was replaced by [Qiemo Yudu Airport](:Qiemo_Yudu_Airport) in December 2016, where Qiemo Town regained commercial air service."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
