<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bogor_Regency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bogor Regency (Indonesian: Kabupaten Bogor) is a landlocked regency (kabupaten) of West Java, Indonesia, south of DKI Jakarta. Covering an area of 2,986.20 km2, it is considered a bedroom community for Jakarta, and was home to 5,427,068 people at the 2020 census. The official estimate as at mid 2021 was 5,489,536. Its administration is located in the town of Cibinong."@en .
