<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Nashua_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Nashua Airport** at **Boire Field** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **ASH**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **KASH**, [FAA](:Federal_Aviation_Administration) [LID](:Location_identifier): **ASH**) is a public-use [airport](:Airport) located three [nautical miles](:Nautical_mile) (6 [km](:Kilometre%29) northwest of the [central business district](:Central_business_district) of [Nashua](:Nashua%2C_New_Hampshire), a city in [Hillsborough County, New Hampshire](:Hillsborough_County%2C_New_Hampshire), United States. Owned by the Nashua Airport Authority, It is included in the [Federal Aviation Administration](:Federal_Aviation_Administration) (FAA) [National Plan of Integrated Airport Systems](:National_Plan_of_Integrated_Airport_Systems) for 2017–2021, in which it is [categorized](:FAA_airport_categories) as a national reliever airport facility."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
