<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Suriname> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Suriname (/ˈsjʊərɪnæm, -nɑːm/) or Surinam, officially the Republic of Suriname (Dutch: Republiek Suriname [reːpyˌblik ˌsyːriˈnaːmə]), is a country on the northeastern Atlantic coast of South America. It is bordered by the Atlantic Ocean to the north, French Guiana to the east, Guyana to the west, and Brazil to the south. At just under 165,000 square kilometers (64,000 square miles), it is the smallest sovereign state in South America."@en .
