<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ocean_City_Municipal_Airport_(Maryland)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Ocean City Municipal Airport** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **OCE**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **KOXB**, [FAA](:Federal_Aviation_Administration) [LID](:Location_identifier): **OXB**) is a public facility serving [Ocean City](:Ocean_City%2C_Maryland), a town in [Worcester County](:Worcester_County%2C_Maryland), [Maryland](:Maryland), [United States](:United_States). It is located 3 [statute miles](:Statute_miles) (5 km) southwest of town, off [Route 611](:Maryland_Route_611) in [West Ocean City](:West_Ocean_City%2C_Maryland).The airport opened in October 1960.Most U.S. airports use the same three-letter [location identifier](:Location_identifier) for the [FAA](:Federal_Aviation_Administration) and [IATA](:International_Air_Transport_Association), but Ocean City Municipal Airport is OXB to the FAA and OCE to the IATA."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
