<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Roscoe_Turner_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Roscoe Turner Airport** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **CRX**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **KCRX**, [FAA](:Federal_Aviation_Administration) [LID](:Location_identifier): **CRX**) is a public-use [airport](:Airport) located four nautical miles (7 km) southwest of the [central business district](:Central_business_district) of [Corinth](:Corinth%2C_Mississippi), a city in [Alcorn County](:Alcorn_County%2C_Mississippi), [Mississippi](:Mississippi), [United States](:United_States). It is owned by the City of Corinth and Alcorn County. This airport is included in the FAA's [National Plan of Integrated Airport Systems](:National_Plan_of_Integrated_Airport_Systems) for 2009–2013, which [categorized](:FAA_airport_categories) it as a *[general aviation](:General_aviation)* facility."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
