<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Emirate_of_Dubai> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Emirate of Dubai (Arabic: إمارة دبيّ; pr. Imārat Dubayy) is one of the seven emirates of the United Arab Emirates. It is the most populous emirate of the UAE. The capital of the emirate is the eponymous city, Dubai."@en .
