<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ouanda_Djallé_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Ouanda Djallé Airport** ([IATA](:IATA_airport_code): **ODJ**, [ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **FEGO**) is an [airstrip](:Airstrip) serving [Ouanda Djallé](:Ouanda_Djall%C3%A9), a village in the [Vakaga](:Vakaga) prefecture of the [Central African Republic](:Central_African_Republic). The airstrip lies alongside the RN5 road that runs northwest out of the village.There is a large hill 3 kilometres (1.9 mi) southeast of the airstrip."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
