<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ouanda_Djallé_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ouanda Djallé Airport (IATA: ODJ, ICAO: FEGO) is an airstrip serving Ouanda Djallé, a village in the Vakaga prefecture of the Central African Republic. The airstrip lies alongside the RN5 road that runs northwest out of the village. There is a large hill 3 kilometres (1.9 mi) southeast of the airstrip."@en .
