<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Galilea_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Galilea Airport** ([ICAO](:ICAO_airport_code): **SPGB**) is an airport serving the river town of Puerto Galilea [(es)](https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puerto%20Galilea) in the [Amazonas Region](:Amazonas_Region) of [Peru](:Peru). The runway is south of the town, which is within a bend of the Rio Santiago, a tributary of the [Marañón River](:Mara%C3%B1%C3%B3n_River), the principal source of the [Amazon River](:Amazon_River)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
